---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navigation from '../components/Navigation.astro';
---

<Layout title="About - My Website" description="Learn more about us">
  <Navigation />
  <main>
    <h1>About Us</h1>
    <p>Museum At Home is the capstone project of Harvard graduate Gianna Romanelli to help provide a more comprehensive search experience for museum-goers and art enthusiasts alike.</p>

    <section>
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>Museum At Home takes the digital materials from museum websites and houses them into once convenient searchable website. 
        The website is designed to help alleviate the stress of filtering through hundreds of resources to find what you are looking for. 
        We are dedicated to providing exceptional service and creating meaningful experiences for everyone!</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Our Values</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Integrity and transparency</li>
        <li>Innovation and creativity</li>
        <li>Community and collaboration</li>
        <li>Forward thinking and ready for the future</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Our Inspiration</h2>
      <p>"In 2022 my godsister Zoe was diagnosed with Acute Lymphoblastic Leukemia (ALL), a type of blood cancer. 
        This lifechanging event turned my world around. I whent from being a graduate student to trying to help Zoe continue with her education while in treatment.
        As a museum studies student, she inspired me to create Museum At Home, a platform that brings the museum experience to those who may not be able to visit in person because of disease, distance, or other barriers."</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  main {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  h1 {
    color: #0066cc;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  h2 {
    color: #004999;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  section {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  ul {
    margin-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  p {
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
</style>
